note From the pilot's translations F12 and F43: fields separated by `and`
note parse as a logical `and` of calls, which is not a condition.
note Expected diagnostic: `and` joins conditions; separate a record's fields with commas.
to decode text
    given text is Text
    produces a Value
    can fail with JSONDecodeError
    fail with JSONDecodeError with msg "Extra data" and doc s and pos end
